{
  "_note": "Mechanical filters for scan.py. Semantic judgement lives in career/search-profile.md. The companies list is a starter watchlist of AI-forward employers on Greenhouse, Lever and Ashby - add, remove, or set active:false freely. The title/location regexes below are tuned for AI and ML engineering roles; rewrite them for your own field.",
